{"game": "the-first-descendant", "language": "english", "appid": 2074920, "month": "2024-08", "window": 3, "start_date": 1723766400, "end_date": 1724457599, "month_true_total": 5081, "quota": 35, "returned": 35, "pulled_at": "2026-10-01 15:46:43 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "173151062", "author": {"steamid": "76561198064148640", "personaname": "the_super_zizo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198064148640/", "num_games_owned": 375, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 4212, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2781, "last_played": 1758314485, "avatar": "02e783ab1a4ff914833d9c8c54da19a07641470f"}, "language": "english", "review": "nice game :)", "timestamp_created": 1724457352, "timestamp_updated": 1724457352, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.493906795978546143", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173150429", "author": {"steamid": "76561197976793898", "personaname": "Hadley", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197976793898/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 1202, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 967, "last_played": 1724619481, "avatar": "9368c6e1a74c562ce9026406b18e4df4b158ff12"}, "language": "english", "review": "I understand some people may be having some performance issues with this game or just don't like it, but I have never seen such a bunch of cry babies complaining over a free game. I have had zero performance issues or crashes.  Its just a matter of optimizing your graphical settings. \n\nI think this game has a lot of potential, because I find it very fun and addicting with lots of challenging tasks.", "timestamp_created": 1724456589, "timestamp_updated": 1724456589, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.48409762978553772", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173149731", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032377645", "personaname": "Yo\"rr gamma ix bae", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198032377645/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 104, "playtime_forever": 4172, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 837, "last_played": 1726462274, "avatar": "c2679f499119852828820aeb9bfb09c2d1d650d9"}, "language": "english", "review": "They fixed my issue ! Game is alot of fun. they need to make earning descedants/mats easier. I think its driving alot of people away, game is too grindy. I dont personally care, but hopefully they rethink this strategy. If you want to make money, being fair will always net way more in the long run. These companies often fail to see that until its too late.\n\nCompanies exist to make money, and thats completely fine! Just need think about your relationship with your players, or else the game will be dead in a few months. If progression seems unobtainable to your average players, casuals will avoid your game. \n\nIts not the worst grind, just worse than the competitors.", "timestamp_created": 1724455771, "timestamp_updated": 1724558235, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.460271298885345459", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173147841", "author": {"steamid": "76561199355477713", "personaname": "angel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199355477713/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 7199, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4257, "last_played": 1733862192, "avatar": "a8c649d50fd576f9a9d7ae01ad7c3551a7917e7b"}, "language": "english", "review": "i love this game its so fun i enjoy putting myself through torture", "timestamp_created": 1724453468, "timestamp_updated": 1724453468, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173147518", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071352005", "personaname": "synthete", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198071352005/", "num_games_owned": 52, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 459, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 403, "last_played": 1736146399, "avatar": "11b61b2801c0127adfde753c7c54c45c209e457d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Gamma is still screwed up, and it's unpredictable, negating the only thing it has going for it, which is \"Ooh, new and pretty\", so the actual moment to moment Gameplay looks like ass for no legitimate reason, and is nothing more than the typical dystopian, shallow, soulless, extortive corporate grindfest that treats you either like a digital serf or someone buying a game piecemeal from a vending machine, ruining any immersion in its \"LoRe\". \r\n\r\nThe physics don't even work properly. No jiggle on a hardsuit? Okay, that makes sense. Silly cosplay bathing suit... and still no jiggle? Why would I even bother getting it? Valby is literally the only reason I gave this a chance, because I liked her aquatic outfit design, and they can't even get the rendering right outside of a cutscene. Some of the outfits are also clearly ripped off from Stellar Blade (white, one-piece, hex-patterned bathing suit, and Valby's thong-harness), which shows how much creativity they'll have going forward.\r\n\r\nAlso, throwing my old 2060super back in my PC for other reasons, and this game can't even max it out in Albion because it's so CPU bottlenecked for whatever reason (I'm guessing player/NPC models), which is bad game performance targeting considering it's an MMO, and tons of people are running something equal to or less powerful than a liquid cooled, overclocked 5600X. Turning down model detail to medium gets above 60FPS, but then it's like I'm back in 2001 with model detail pop-in 3 meters away. Oh, how far we've come. (And yes, I turned it down to 1080p and turned down all the effects, GI, and shadows. Also, none of those settings, even maxxed out on a 6900XT could fix the gamma issues in-game, so it's just a rendering problem with the way the game renders in a combat area.)", "timestamp_created": 1724453099, "timestamp_updated": 1724453099, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.506972134113311768", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173147450", "author": {"steamid": "76561198078239835", "personaname": "Lord Sadsack", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198078239835/", "num_games_owned": 320, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 19583, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19571, "deck_playtime_at_review": 4377, "last_played": 1728117913, "avatar": "f46b06859b4f297cee7b810d37f4ea2e4505a533"}, "language": "english", "review": "The characters are great, story was enjoyable, graphics and sound effects are also great. They have everything in those regards to have a great live service game. Only downside is that once you get to the higher levels and choose to play any character other than Bunny well.... its just a walking sim. Follow bunny into a mission, pick stuff up with no ability to even fire your gun before the mobs are dead, Follow bunny some more, pick up stuff, get force pulled into a boss fight while materials you were looking for are laying on the ground. \r\n\r\nPeople say \"Go play private, gitgud, or some other stupid nonsense. But why would anybody want to be forced to play a specific character they have no interest in while farming? Why should i be forced to walk behind people and just pick stuff up for 5 hours then log off and feel like I have accomplished something, Its not worth it, the honeymoon phase has worn off. I don't care if its a PVE game, some characters need a nerf to make other characters applicable for content. \r\n\r\nIts a korean game, i get it, just farm farm farm and get your life sucked out only thinking about doing bunny runs and unlocking characters you will never use until a new character drops and you are back to bunny farming again. Maybe ill return if some things get some meaningful balance but until then its a waste of time and any sane person will agree after a few hundred hours. Its just not worth it.", "timestamp_created": 1724453019, "timestamp_updated": 1724453019, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.434650450944900513", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173147024", "author": {"steamid": "76561198196251295", "personaname": "Floof", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198196251295/", "num_games_owned": 82, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 19, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9, "last_played": 1724527129, "avatar": "7eebf4c9b077c4537461b5c3aa205e2cf4d4e557"}, "language": "english", "review": "game wont start\n", "timestamp_created": 1724452529, "timestamp_updated": 1724452529, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.434782594442367554", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173146353", "author": {"steamid": "76561199406289834", "personaname": "xdhe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/xdhe/", "num_games_owned": 62, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 8976, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2679, "last_played": 1763870591, "avatar": "7473414639cd2fef6515c364695c8486796c2fb8"}, "language": "english", "review": "better than once human", "timestamp_created": 1724451764, "timestamp_updated": 1724451764, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173146233", "author": {"steamid": "76561198442552813", "personaname": "MagicEmperor", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198442552813/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 129337, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3384, "playtime_at_review": 30507, "last_played": 1790830948, "avatar": "1454c7d29372359bf8b4b3f42b4158b837f41c9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "10/10", "timestamp_created": 1724451662, "timestamp_updated": 1724451662, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173146012", "author": {"steamid": "76561198080280341", "personaname": "Azule", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/THE-ACPB/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 752, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 706, "last_played": 1726359933, "avatar": "eab79d3d9f80e2ee3cc6b0d31d7621f171d66cf6"}, "language": "english", "review": "idk have not played in a while... also yes i liked this game", "timestamp_created": 1724451437, "timestamp_updated": 1724451437, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173145523", "author": {"steamid": "76561198121095762", "personaname": "slushanator", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198121095762/", "num_games_owned": 220, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3222, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1833, "last_played": 1726979284, "avatar": "9d09ae819ca5617c6f39f22c30b83e1c01831889"}, "language": "english", "review": "TLDR: gooner warframe with fun gameplay held back a little by some missing QoL features and high store prices. (but also the prices for skins are kinda the standard now) \r\n\r\nits got great gunplay and fun abilities. Microtransactions are more like macrotransactions but theyre not required so i dont really care, except for paints - imagine if destiny shaders were still single use, and you had to pay a fee for each paint use.\r\ndevs so far have really been listening to feedback eg season 1 originally was gonna have like 3 content drops spread out over the months which wouldve meant waiting until oct 30th for some of the content, but within a few days they changed it so the 2nd and 3rd content drops would happen together and earlier", "timestamp_created": 1724450890, "timestamp_updated": 1724450890, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173145402", "author": {"steamid": "76561199504416130", "personaname": "greyson614", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199504416130/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 564, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 420, "last_played": 1724591147, "avatar": "d7cc4ac6d5b6ca3421d3c59a1b116ff5702cfc64"}, "language": "english", "review": "it is so fun", "timestamp_created": 1724450729, "timestamp_updated": 1724450729, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173145291", "author": {"steamid": "76561199144550001", "personaname": "Scar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199144550001/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 11302, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7672, "deck_playtime_at_review": 98, "last_played": 1748529708, "avatar": "034537366673ccdf2508ebe16bc138fa4ce6a7da"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game as long as you like to grind for hours and wait for hours", "timestamp_created": 1724450616, "timestamp_updated": 1724450616, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173144652", "author": {"steamid": "76561198054090242", "personaname": "NuclearWinter", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/01Nuclear_Winter__/", "num_games_owned": 140, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 299, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 299, "last_played": 1719980074, "avatar": "a06fae6f5772e02ad6f8fb5d89819bd939bd94b2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just play warframe, Nexon is awfull", "timestamp_created": 1724449917, "timestamp_updated": 1724449917, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173144283", "author": {"steamid": "76561197990239827", "personaname": "Lazy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LazyTheViking/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 15202, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1669, "last_played": 1761131091, "avatar": "5fea668694c95ff82c2d9cc2b2afdb06a9d2bbb4"}, "language": "english", "review": "it game, it loot, it pewpew", "timestamp_created": 1724449515, "timestamp_updated": 1724449515, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173144220", "author": {"steamid": "76561198015400388", "personaname": "TheTots", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thetots/", "num_games_owned": 2896, "num_reviews": 157, "playtime_forever": 6559, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4510, "last_played": 1770446940, "avatar": "14c3bd823a60798cce60d4568e796d54f6af8a8c"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game offers exactly what I'm coming to one of these for. I was a huge Warframe fan but dropped off for a few years. Trying to go back with a formerly high level character and figure out how to play again and what is going on was just, a lot to deal with. \r\n\r\nTFD offers what I enjoyed about the loop in Warframe, and I can get it on the ground floor. It's a fresh start to get into this genre. The grinds are what I'd expect, and I like some of the quality of life features that help you find exactly what you're going after easily. \r\n\r\nI lived on the Warframe wiki, I haven't needed to hardly glance at one for this. Most of what I need is there in game in an intuitive way. \r\n\r\nI've had nothing but positive interactions with the community. The drop in drop out co op is painless. There is some basically forced grouping for a few activities but the game can largely be played solo. \r\n\r\nI've unlocked about half the characters without really going after any of them in a hard way. I just kind of organically ended up with the mats. \r\n\r\nOverall, fun game. I think you could reasonably play this as a free player and have a great time.", "timestamp_created": 1724449434, "timestamp_updated": 1724449434, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173142118", "author": {"steamid": "76561198297382636", "personaname": "Nightspore", "persona_statu