"votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173135433", "author": {"steamid": "76561198369959216", "personaname": "EYESOFICE83", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198369959216/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 74816, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3284, "last_played": 1751644096, "avatar": "5261bbb3579392b1b846981f6e83a00ac9dcedda"}, "language": "english", "review": "...", "timestamp_created": 1724441080, "timestamp_updated": 1724778504, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173135273", "author": {"steamid": "76561198048240343", "personaname": "Muew", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198048240343/", "num_games_owned": 87, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 24712, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11838, "last_played": 1777584279, "avatar": "191f9ca493abf3e285903ca6e6cabfcc016075b3"}, "language": "english", "review": "I usually dislike grindy games and this is a grindy game and a half. However I picked it up to try the game out and I couldn't stop playing. Still can't, game is very enjoyable, characters are very unique with cool abilities that play differently from each other. \r\n\r\nBoss Fights are fun and new ones come with cool mechanics. There is a lot of grind and exp grind is kinda frustrating but getting the items and characters you farmed for is very satisfying.\r\n\r\nOn top of that the devs have been super cool listening to all feedback and revising their decisions when the community asks them to, so far every patch has been extremely well received and that doesn't look to be changing anytime soon with Season 1 revised release dates.", "timestamp_created": 1724440951, "timestamp_updated": 1724440951, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.522471904754638672", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173134079", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049486537", "personaname": "Mr._.Juan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TheOneJuan/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 77, "playtime_forever": 24, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 24, "last_played": 1724439728, "avatar": "6373c031ba757332ef48c907818963e43f36a660"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's not even playable. Runs like garbage even on lowest settings. Not worth your time.", "timestamp_created": 1724439939, "timestamp_updated": 1724439939, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497942358255386353", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173133055", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011507844", "personaname": "Fishizzle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198011507844/", "num_games_owned": 393, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 15879, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 341, "last_played": 1727744118, "avatar": "8d18afedecb76593f2773a5b7b393943f231085c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Decent game that would probably be fun if not for 1 big reason. Level 40s running around every zone killing everything. Que for that first big boss fight?...better do it solo or else you'll have 3 level 40s seeing who can one shot it first. Queing for the dungeon at the end of each zone?...better do it solo or you'll have 3 level 40s running through it one shotting every mob. See the problem? If not let me be more specific. If all I see in low level zones and other low level content is level 40s, there must not be anything worth doing that is scaled for level 40s.\n\nEdit: After giving it more time I have grown to like it...and its free so I'm changing to a thumbs up. My earlier problems still stand but I get it just how the game was designed...lots of grinding modules/weapons/ect. Just need to get to max level and it starts to fall in place.", "timestamp_created": 1724439144, "timestamp_updated": 1724802138, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173132631", "author": {"steamid": "76561198168247898", "personaname": "Widow Son", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198168247898/", "num_games_owned": 94, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 602, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 602, "last_played": 1724438373, "avatar": "6af4d0bd270be7036f30d9f7489f6dc54c8ec46e"}, "language": "english", "review": "RennsReviews's video on First Descendant is pretty much how I feel about the game plus more, movement is a shame how the heck do you forget to implement crouching and sliding into a third person shooter game that requires you to move around a lot in those big open areas like kingston and sterile lands and so on. Grappling hook is lack luster and the monetization .... oh boy. This is the warfame that your mom says you guys have at home. This is Warframe if it embraced Chinese warframe's monetization practices. This is bootleg destiny 2. This is the result of Warframe and Destiny 2 having a child together and that child came out discombobulated. There's a lot of Booba though can't argue with that.", "timestamp_created": 1724438803, "timestamp_updated": 1724438803, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173132442", "author": {"steamid": "76561198163004121", "personaname": "KaiYLX", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198163004121/", "num_games_owned": 273, "num_reviews": 74, "playtime_forever": 149710, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1734, "playtime_at_review": 791, "last_played": 1790821188, "avatar": "ad0c78483b7c24ddaf4b5ef6aaa513d52085d9b5"}, "language": "english", "review": "remids me of destiny but third person and prettier character models", "timestamp_created": 1724438664, "timestamp_updated": 1724438664, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "173130571", "author": {"steamid": "76561198859162324", "personaname": "TheTungstenTentacle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198859162324/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 19141, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14979, "last_played": 1771093034, "avatar": "c293c28982636383df5